    "detailed_description": "Prophecy Island is a randomly generated open world action rpg. Every new playthrough you start will set you up with a new island to explore, new dungeons to explore, a remixed main adventure and generated side-quest lines. It started out as a passion project and has grown into the game it is now. The goal is to provide a unique, small to medium sized adventure for players, every time they start a new playthrough. You can follow it's development through the Nether Tree Games Youtube channel, where devlog videos are uploaded every month.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>The game is ofcourse in development, so everything here is technically subject to change, but these features do represent the core idea behind Prophecy Island.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Randomly Generated Island</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/a120e82816e7e21ec1d00f3f5c09050c.avif?t=1750083552\" /></span><br>Every playthrough brings it's own unique island, main city, buildings, dungeons, npc's and more.<br><br></li><li><strong>Unique Adventure</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/dc0ed43fd639b884689dedb861cc65ec.avif?t=1750083552\" /></span><br>The main story line is remixed every playthrough, delivering a compelling story to play through with twists to the story to keep it fresh. Alongside this main quest-line are also generated side-quest lines that help create more unique adventures every playthrough.<br><br></li><li><strong>Combat</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/29839bc946cb50abed76df668f0d9cbc.avif?t=1750083552\" /></span><br>Combat is inspired by the souls-like genre. Weapons will have their own unique combat-style, but with some added mechanics to make looting more fun. A magic system is also in the works. Once there's more info on that this page will be updated as soon as possible.<br><br></li><li><strong>RPG elements</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/f846c9469c0de58e878d04c32ec0fa71.avif?t=1750083552\" /></span><br>Ofcourse players will be able to build their own character, but it's more then just shaping a face and assigning combat stats. A system with dialogue options as a potential way of solving quests through diplomacy or charisma skills is also present in Prophecy Island.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Prophecy Island is a randomly generated open world action rpg. Every new playthrough you start will set you up with a new island to explore, new dungeons to explore, a remixed main adventure and generated side-quest lines. It started out as a passion project and has grown into the game it is now. The goal is to provide a unique, small to medium sized adventure for players, every time they start a new playthrough. You can follow it's development through the Nether Tree Games Youtube channel, where devlog videos are uploaded every month.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>The game is ofcourse in development, so everything here is technically subject to change, but these features do represent the core idea behind Prophecy Island.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Randomly Generated Island</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/a120e82816e7e21ec1d00f3f5c09050c.avif?t=1750083552\" /></span><br>Every playthrough brings it's own unique island, main city, buildings, dungeons, npc's and more.<br><br></li><li><strong>Unique Adventure</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/dc0ed43fd639b884689dedb861cc65ec.avif?t=1750083552\" /></span><br>The main story line is remixed every playthrough, delivering a compelling story to play through with twists to the story to keep it fresh. Alongside this main quest-line are also generated side-quest lines that help create more unique adventures every playthrough.<br><br></li><li><strong>Combat</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/29839bc946cb50abed76df668f0d9cbc.avif?t=1750083552\" /></span><br>Combat is inspired by the souls-like genre. Weapons will have their own unique combat-style, but with some added mechanics to make looting more fun. A magic system is also in the works. Once there's more info on that this page will be updated as soon as possible.<br><br></li><li><strong>RPG elements</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414450/extras/f846c9469c0de58e878d04c32ec0fa71.avif?t=1750083552\" /></span><br>Ofcourse players will be able to build their own character, but it's more then just shaping a face and assigning combat stats. A system with dialogue options as a potential way of solving quests through diplomacy or charisma skills is also present in Prophecy Island.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Prophecy Island is a randomly generated open world action rpg. As the player you get the opportunity to start an entirely new adventure every playthrough, with a remixed main storyline, generated side-quest lines, a new island, new dungeons and so much more.",
